# Input

```scss
%base{color:red}
.a { @extend %base
}
.b{@extend %missing   !optional}
.c{ @import   "theme.css"
}
.d{ @foo   bar
}
.explicit { @extend %base; @import "theme.css"; @foo bar; color:blue }
.extend-comment { @extend %base // target
/* close extend */ }
.import-comment{ @import "theme.css" // target
/* close import */ }
.unknown-comment { @foo bar // value
/* close unknown */ }
.after{width:1px}

```


# Formatted

```scss
%base {
	color: red;
}
.a {
	@extend %base;
}
.b {
	@extend %missing !optional;
}
.c {
	@import "theme.css";
}
.d {
	@foo bar;
}
.explicit {
	@extend %base;
	@import "theme.css";
	@foo bar;
	color: blue;
}
.extend-comment {
	@extend %base // target
	/* close extend */;
}
.import-comment {
	@import "theme.css" // target
	/* close import */;
}
.unknown-comment {
	@foo bar // value
	/* close unknown */;
}
.after {
	width: 1px;
}

```
